    {
      "sourceAlias": "L0834:S0",
      "page": 21,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "Note that the suffixes use in total mlog(n/m) bits. We store EF1 = (00,01,00,00,10,01,00,11)",
