    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L0835:S0",
      "page": 21,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "with the packed array data structure of Theorem 1.3.9. As far as the prefixes are concerned, observe",
      "label": "OTHER",
